  "products": [
    {
      "id": 8952226545971,
      "title": "8.5L Extra-Large Plastic Food Storage Containers \u2013 Set of 2",
      "handle": "extra-large-8-5l-plastic-food-storage-containers-set-of-2",
      "body_html": "<p><span>Our extra-large 8.5L Plastic Food Storage Containers - Set of 2, is designed to revolutionize your kitchen organization. It is made from BPA-free ABS and SAN plastic and offers a safe and food-grade solution for storing kitchen-related items. Their clear design ensures easy identification of contents, while the set includes 2 matching measuring cups, perfect for precise portioning of ingredients like coffee, grains, flour, sugar, and pet food. These containers boast ample space to accommodate a variety of pantry staples.</span></p>\n<p><span>Not only do these 4pcs Extra Large Food Storage Containers set of 2 offer generous storage capacity, but they also feature a space-saving design that maximizes kitchen space. Their wide and tall shape allows for efficient storage of more food items, while the modular design facilitates easy stacking and organization within your pantry. Equipped with secure sealing lids with blue silicone gaskets, these containers ensure an airtight seal to keep your food fresh for longer durations. With the bonus of waterproof and reusable labels and a marker, labeling and organizing your pantry has never been simpler.</span></p>",
