    {
      "id": 8952223793459,
      "title": "6.5L Plastic Food Containers \u2013 Set of 2",
      "handle": "6-5l-plastic-food-container-set-of-2",
      "body_html": "<p><span>Keep your pantry staples organized and easily accessible with our set of two 6.5L plastic food containers featuring clear lids. These extra-large containers are perfect for meeting all your storage needs, whether for storing dry goods like grains, spices, or pet food, or keeping leftovers fresh. The containers feature secure side-locking lids with blue silicone gaskets, ensuring a tight and airtight seal to keep food fresh and prevent spills. Additionally, the set comes with eighteen waterproof, reusable labels for easy organization.</span></p>\n<p><span>This 6.5L plastic food container set consists of two containers with clear lids, each measuring 11.2 inches in height, 6.8 inches in width, and 6 inches in length. The BPA-free, ABS &amp; SAN plastic construction ensures food safety while the clear design allows for easy identification of contents. With two measuring cups included, portioning out ingredients is a breeze. Say goodbye to cluttered shelves and hello to a more organized kitchen with our space-saving, modular design.</span></p>",
